/result

# SwiftPM
.spm-build/
# A scratch path only the `just test` gate builds into. The compiler reports a function
# body over lib/TerminalCore's type-check budget only when it type-checks that body, so
# the gate can only measure what its own build has to recompile. A tree nothing else
# warms guarantees that window: every file changed since the last gate run is
# re-type-checked, and therefore measured, during the run that judges it. Other packages
# use the name for step independence.
.build-gate/
# The root app/CLI tests are an independent parallel gate step and need their own SwiftPM build tree.
.build-app-tests/
# iOS cross-compile trees: one per pinned package for scripts/ios-portability-gate.sh,
# plus the per-module trees and logs of docs/research/35-ios-remote-client/ios-cross-compile.sh.
.build-ios-*/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved
__pycache__/

# Reproducible external source checkouts (materialize with `just fetch-references`).
/references/
